- Z TriFold ;
- Z Fold 8 Ultra, Z Fold 8, Z Flip 8 ;
- Z Fold 7, Z Flip 7, Z Flip 7 FE ;
- Z Fold 6, Z Flip 6.
Les Galaxy S
